    "contentRequirement": "勤于动手，乐于实践，敢于创新",
    "intro": "这名十九岁的英国少年，把乐高玩出了新花样。",
    "hasVideo": false
  },
  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you like playing with Lego "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bricks",
            "zh": "砖块"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Kit Nugent, a 19-year-old from the U.K., surely does. And now he’s wowing the Lego world. This year, he became the youngest of only 17 designers "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to show their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "models",
            "ref": "v-model"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Lego House",
            "zh": "乐高之家"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Denmark. Three of his "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are now shown for visitors to see."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Kit began building with Lego when he was only five. His neighbours "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and left him a big box of bricks, but without any "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "instructions",
            "ref": "v-instruction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “I started building my own models,” he said. “I’ve been doing it ever since.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Kit’s creations are full of fun "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One model shows Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson. He used almost 1,000 bricks. Sherlock’s nose is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from a Lego dog piece, while Watson’s nose is a tiny chicken piece. Another model, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Old Man and the Sea"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", shows a man "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a giant blue fish. Kit even "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " pictures of real fish carefully to make the design better. He also built a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "two-story cottage",
            "zh": "两层小屋"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " called "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Blooming Thatch"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《茅草小屋》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He used 1,200 Lego "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wands",
            "zh": "小棍"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to build it. The boy spent two years testing different ways to make the roof look "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, Kit is studying "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "architecture",
            "zh": "建筑"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Cambridge University",
            "zh": "剑桥大学"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". According to him, Lego has helped him learn to be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and taught him how to solve problems. “Seeing my own work at Lego House feels really "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” the young designer said."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "vocabulary": [
      {
